  "summary_en": "UN Secretary-General's report under resolution 78/241 consolidating Member State and observer views on lethal autonomous weapons systems, with annexed submissions from states, ICRC and civil society. It covers definitions, human control, IHL compliance, and next steps, and calls for a legally binding instrument by 2026 prohibiting and regulating LAWS.",
